{{!-- Back link on a child page (S5, 1.6.0): one pattern at the top of the page head — a plain link,
"← Portfolio", an underline on hover or keyboard focus, no tab-bar look. `href` is the target page
(with its leading slash), `label` its name. The post page adds the category after it (blog-post.html). --}}
<nav class="back-nav" aria-label="Back">
  <a class="back-link" href="{{href}}"
    ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6" /></svg
    ><span class="link">{{label}}</span></a>
</nav>
